^{:go/end 2417} (go/func findIntrinsic "findIntrinsic returns a function which builds the SSA equivalent of the\nfunction identified by the symbol sym.  If sym is not an intrinsic call, returns nil.\n" ^intrinsicBuilder [^{:tag (* types/Sym)} sym]
